<urn:anchor:223> <urn:quote> "If we specify the set V and tell how to add its elements and how to multiply them by numbers, we get a concrete example of a linear space." .
<urn:anchor:224> <urn:quote> "The reader can easily verify that each of the following examples satisfies all the axioms for a real linear space." .
