<urn:anchor:666> <urn:quote> "AXIOM 6. EXISTENCE OF NEGATIVES. For every x in V, the element $(-1)x$ has the property" .
<urn:anchor:667> <urn:quote> "Axiom 6 tells us that each x has at least one negative, namely $(-1)x$" .
